# Go build and test output
#
# `verse` is the binary name used by render.yaml, .github/workflows/ci.yml and the Dockerfile
# (`-o verse`). It was previously unignored, so a local build showed up in git status.
/verse
*.test
coverage.out
vendor/

# server runtime
#
# Already listed in .dockerignore; named here so a local run does not leave them in the working
# tree. The pre-v0.3.7 CI wrote both; ad-hoc local runs still do.
server.log
server.pid
*.log
